ass=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    icon</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  savingsMessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信任元素</th>\n<th>放置位置</th>\n<th>转化率影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SSL 锁标识</td>\n<td>浏览器地址栏+支付区域</td>\n<td>+2-3%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付品牌Logo</td>\n<td>支付方式选择区</td>\n<td>+3-5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款保障</td>\n<td>订单确认按钮上方</td>\n<td>+5-8%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时客服入口</td>\n<td>页面右下角</td>\n<td>+3-5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全支付文案</td>\n<td>提交按钮内</td>\n<td>+1-3%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>收银台是转化漏斗的关键瓶颈，平均购物车放弃率约 70%，流程复杂是主要原因之一</li>\n<li>单页结账适合低SKU高复购场景，多步结账适合信息量大的跨境场景，A/B 测试是最终决策依据</li>\n<li>表单优化三原则：最少字段、正确的 autocomplete 属性、实时内联验证</li>\n<li>移动端优化核心是减少输入，Express Checkout（Apple/Google Pay）可将转化率提升 10-15%</li>\n<li>信任标识和费用透明是消除支付焦虑的关键，费用应在购物车阶段就展示估算</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"收银台流程设计","id":"收银台流程设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"单页结账与多步结账","id":"单页结账与多步结账"},{"level":2,"text":"表单设计与自动填充","id":"表单设计与自动填充"},{"level":2,"text":"移动端结账优化","id":"移动端结账优化"},{"level":2,"text":"信任标识与安全感设计","id":"信任标识与安全感设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"支付安全体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/payment-fundamentals/payment-security"},"next":{"title":"购物车放弃与挽回策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ec